# Files managed by `bin/wage`: one plaintext path per line, relative to this
# repo's root, with the ciphertext committed as `<path>.encrypted` beside it.
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# A plaintext with no ciphertext beside it is not managed: `status` reports it
# as decrypted, because existence is all it can check in that direction.
#
# The recipient is here because it is a public key and its history shows who it
# was written for. Where the matching secret key lives is `WAGE_IDENTITY_PATH`
# (default: the `age/wage` entry in gopass), never a line in this file, because
# this file travels with the repo.
RECIPIENT=age1hyzsy9lcheqjjcwpvs6nvfxu6ns30tg8we7vxhnvc7wl3r0v496sqk5jv9

aspects/dotfiles/files/.config/glab-cli/readme.md
# aspects/dotfiles/files/.config/wireguard/work.conf
# aspects/dotfiles/files/.local/bin/keepassxc-wf
# aspects/dotfiles/files/.local/bin/mount-shares
# aspects/ssh/files/.ssh/config
